#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview {#plans-overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw ng mga plano {#plans-overview}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Platform has Open (free access) and paid plans, as described below. See [IBM Quantum access plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) for full details. Note that usage for all plans is  tracked in [_resource units (RUs)_](#rus).\n"
msgstr "Ang IBM Quantum Platform ay may Open (libreng access) at mga bayad na plano, tulad ng inilalarawan sa ibaba. Tingnan ang [IBM Quantum access plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) para sa kumpletong detalye. Tandaan na ang usage para sa lahat ng plano ay sinusubaybayan sa [_resource units (RUs)_](#rus).\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want access to multiple plans, you can create multiple instances and assign different plans to them.  For example, you can have an Open Plan instance and a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can set preferred instances to use in the `QiskitRuntimeService` initializer or `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` method.  Example:\n"
msgstr "Kung gusto mong ma-access ang maraming plano, puwede kang gumawa ng maraming instance at mag-assign ng iba't ibang plano sa mga ito. Halimbawa, puwede kang magkaroon ng Open Plan instance at isang Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance. Puwede mong itakda ang mga preferred na instance sa `QiskitRuntimeService` initializer o sa `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` method. Halimbawa:\n"

