#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"rus\" />\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"rus\" />\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-02
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resource units {#resource-units}"
msgstr "Mga yunit ng resource {#resource-units}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As of November 2026, IBM Quantum Platform is expanding beyond access to quantum processing units (QPUs) to offer additional services, including functions and managed workflows that bring quantum and classical computing together.\n"
msgstr "Simula Nobyembre 2026, lumalawak ang IBM Quantum Platform lampas sa access sa mga quantum processing unit (QPU) para mag-alok ng mga karagdagang serbisyo, kabilang ang mga function at managed workflow na pinagsasama ang quantum at classical computing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To support these capabilities, IBM Quantum is introducing Resource Units (RUs), a flexible unit for measuring and managing resource consumption across different services.\n"
msgstr "Para suportahan ang mga kakayahang ito, ipinakikilala ng IBM Quantum ang Resource Units (RUs), isang flexible na yunit para sukatin at pamahalaan ang konsumo ng resource sa iba't ibang serbisyo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For standard QPU workloads, 1 RU = 1 minute of QPU compute time. For Premium Plan customers, 1 RU is equivalent to 1 Value Unit (VU) for standard QPU workloads. This means there are no changes to current QPU pricing or existing contracts, although capacity and usage are now displayed in RUs.\n"
msgstr "Para sa mga karaniwang QPU workload, 1 RU = 1 minuto ng QPU compute time. Para sa mga customer ng Premium Plan, ang 1 RU ay katumbas ng 1 Value Unit (VU) para sa mga karaniwang QPU workload. Ibig sabihin, walang pagbabago sa kasalukuyang presyo ng QPU o sa mga umiiral na kontrata, bagaman ipinapakita na ngayon sa RU ang capacity at usage.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Different services might consume RUs at different rates depending on the resources used.\n"
msgstr "Maaaring mag-iba ang rate ng pagkonsumo ng RU ng iba't ibang serbisyo depende sa mga resource na ginamit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Dry-run jobs\">\n"
"[Dry-run jobs](/guides/dry-run-jobs) do not consume RUs. A dry-run job reports the usage in RUs that the same job would incur on a real QPU, but that usage is not charged, does not consume your plan allocation, and does not count against any limits. Dry-run jobs are available on the Flex, Premium, and On-Prem plans.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga dry-run job\">\n"
"Hindi kumokonsumo ng RU ang [Dry-run jobs](/guides/dry-run-jobs). Iniuulat ng isang dry-run job ang usage sa RU na magagamit ng parehong job sa totoong QPU, pero hindi ito sinisingil, hindi kumokonsumo ng iyong plan allocation, at hindi binibilang sa anumang limitasyon. Available ang mga dry-run job sa mga plan na Flex, Premium, at On-Prem.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan {#open-plan}"
msgstr "Open Plan {#open-plan}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run your quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (the RU equivalent of up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). You can track your usage on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.  Open Plan instances can only be created in the us-east region (you can switch regions from the drop-down menu at the top of the Platform dashboard). [Click to go the sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang iyong quantum circuits sa pinakamahuhusay na QPU sa buong mundo nang libre (ang resource unit (RU) na katumbas ng hanggang 10 minuto bawat 28-araw na rolling window). Maaari mong subaybayan ang iyong paggamit sa mga pahina ng [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) at [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).  Ang mga Open Plan instance ay maaari lamang gawin sa us-east region (maaari kang lumipat ng region mula sa drop-down menu sa itaas ng Platform dashboard). [I-click para pumunta sa sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are learning quantum computing and exploring IBM quantum technology.\n"
msgstr "Inirerekomenda ang planong ito para sa mga natututo pa lang ng quantum computing at nagte-explore ng IBM quantum technology.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limited time promotion\">\n"
"As of 16 March 2026, active Open Plan users can opt in to the RU equivalent of an additional 180 minutes over the next 12 months.\n"
"Read the [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) blog for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Promosyon sa Limitadong Panahon\">\n"
"Simula 16 Marso 2026, ang mga aktibong user ng Open Plan ay maaaring mag-opt in para sa resource unit (RU) na katumbas ng karagdagang 180 minuto sa loob ng susunod na 12 buwan.\n"
"Basahin ang blog na [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) para sa buong detalye.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"
msgstr "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pre-purchase a certain number of RUs (equivalent to 400 or more minutes) for running quantum jobs, to be used within one year of purchase.  You can purchase more RUs at any time.\n"
msgstr "Mag-pre-purchase ng tiyak na bilang ng RU (katumbas ng 400 o higit pang minuto) para sa pagpapatakbo ng mga quantum job, na gagamitin sa loob ng isang taon mula sa pagbili.  Puwede kang bumili ng dagdag na RU anumang oras.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After purchasing RUs, you must allocate them to existing or new instances on the Flex Plan for your account.  Set or update allocation limits on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) or set the allocation when you [create a new Flex Plan instance](/guides/instances).  If you allocate all of the RUs to existing instances, you can't create a new instance for the Flex Plan until you purchase more RUs or remove some RUs from another instance's allocation. See [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos bumili ng RUs, kailangan mo itong i-allocate sa mga kasalukuyan o bagong instance sa Flex Plan para sa iyong account.  Itakda o i-update ang mga allocation limit sa [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) o itakda ang allocation kapag [gumawa ka ng bagong Flex Plan instance](/guides/instances).  Kung na-allocate mo na ang lahat ng RUs sa mga kasalukuyang instance, hindi ka makakagawa ng bagong instance para sa Flex Plan hanggang bumili ka ng dagdag na RUs o mag-alis ng ilang RUs mula sa allocation ng ibang instance. Tingnan ang [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) para matuto pa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need more than the RU equivalent of 10,000 minutes, you should consider a Premium Plan subscription instead. \n"
msgstr "Kung kailangan mo ng higit sa katumbas sa RU ng 10,000 minuto, dapat mong isaalang-alang ang isang Premium Plan subscription. \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-02
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't want to purchase RUs equivalent to 400 or more minutes, consider the Pay-As-You-Go Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Kung ayaw mong bumili ng RU na katumbas ng 400 o higit pang minuto, isaalang-alang ang Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up for a Flex Plan.\n"
msgstr "[Makipag-ugnayan sa IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para mag-sign up sa Flex Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs and pay only for the QPU consumption you use.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga quantum circuit sa pinakamahuhusay na QPU sa buong mundo at magbayad lamang para sa QPU consumption na iyong ginagamit.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are performing quantum utility research projects and testing business models with flexible access. If you will be using at least 400 minutes in the next year, it is recommended that you use the Flex Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Inirerekomenda ang planong ito para sa mga nagsasagawa ng quantum utility research projects at sumusubok ng mga business model na may flexible na access. Kung gagamit ka ng hindi bababa sa 400 minuto sa susunod na taon, inirerekomenda na gamitin mo na lang ang Flex Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"
msgstr "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs using an enterprise subscription. Additionally, some functionality, such as [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), is available to Premium Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga quantum circuit sa pinakamahuhusay na QPU sa buong mundo gamit ang enterprise subscription. Bukod pa rito, ang ilang functionality, tulad ng [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), ay available sa mga gumagamit ng Premium Plan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who want to execute a strategic quantum roadmap and develop quantum algorithms and applications at scale. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Inirerekomenda ang planong ito para sa mga gustong magsagawa ng estratehikong quantum roadmap at mag-develop ng mga quantum algorithm at application sa malaking sukat. [Makipag-ugnayan sa IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para matuto pa.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"
msgstr "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access an entirely dedicated on-premises quantum system that is serviced and maintained by IBM Quantum.\n"
msgstr "Ma-access ang isang ganap na dedicated na on-premises quantum system na sineserbisyuhan at pinapanatili ng IBM Quantum.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This service is recommended for those who are exploring classical quantum algorithms and applications and need high control over their resources and data. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Inirerekomenda ang serbisyong ito para sa mga nagse-explore ng mga classical quantum algorithm at application at nangangailangan ng mataas na kontrol sa kanilang mga resource at data. [Makipag-ugnayan sa IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) para matuto pa.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Compare available plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Understand what counts as [usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Learn about the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Access plans by creating [instances](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade from the Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  -  [Ikumpara ang mga available na plano](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Alamin kung ano ang binibilang bilang [paggamit](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Matuto tungkol sa [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  I-access ang mga plano sa pamamagitan ng paglikha ng mga [instance](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Mag-upgrade mula sa Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
